    Component Build Protocol (applies to all 4 components):
        Step 1: Structure — semantic HTML, accessibility roles, focus management
        Step 2: Layout — Flex/Grid, responsive breakpoints, aspect ratios
        Step 3: Styling — color tokens, typography, border styles, spacing scale
        Step 4: Interactivity — Framer Motion transitions, hover/focus states, user events
        Step 5: Test (automated) — behaviour test as specified below
        Step 6: Visual smoke test — log screenshot result or manual review note with date
        Step 7: LOCKDOWN this component before touching the next

